---

# Testing

- Unit-test pure utils (sort, filter, format, search, security redaction)
- Mock-test at repository/service boundaries with `jest.fn()` fakes
- Component-test widgets with React Native Testing Library
- Detox E2E: list → search/filter → detail → share; use stable `testID`s
- New feature work includes matching unit and/or mock tests
- Avoid flaky real timers in mock tests — inject delays or mock them
